cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "squirrelpapers.github.io: site generator for the Squirrel Papers journal"
abstract: >-
  Builds the website of the Squirrel Papers (ISSN 2750-560X), an Open Access
  journal of the Research Squirrel Engineers Network, from YAML: one page per
  volume, issue and entry in English and German, citations in several styles,
  BibTeX, a DCAT 3 / DCAT-AP 3 graph with a CIDOC CRM bridge, SHACL
  validation, a browser SPARQL page and a map of conference venues.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Thiery
    given-names: Florian
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-3246-3531"
license: MIT
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-10-06"
repository-code: "https://github.com/squirrelpapers/squirrelpapers.github.io"
url: "https://squirrelpapers.github.io/"
keywords:
  - Squirrel Papers
  - Open Access journal
  - Linked Open Data
  - DCAT
  - CIDOC CRM
  - Research Software Engineering
